        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/URLPattern\" rel=\"nofollow\">URL Pattern API</a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1731418\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1731418</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note and some minor corrections to current Web API template style.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249068112\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40474\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40474/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40474\">#40474</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40632",
            "title": "FF142 Relnote: URL Pattern API",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-05T06:39:25.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-05T04:17:05.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
